ator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onGeometryChange(for:of:action:)-1xv8z":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/ongeometrychange(for:of:action:)-1xv8z","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onGeometryChange(for:of:action:)-1xv8z","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onGeometryChange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".Type, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"of","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"GeometryProxy","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI13GeometryProxyV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"action","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","